me brings the same ritual home: lie down, start the session, and let light, heat, and PEMF work together.{% endif %}{% else %}{% if is_fr %}Beaucoup d'appareils de luminoth&eacute;rapie finissent dans un placard. Antared est con&ccedil;u pour rester visible : silencieux, &eacute;l&eacute;gant et assez simple pour devenir un rituel aussi naturel que le caf&eacute; du matin.{% else %}Most red light therapy devices sit in a closet after the first week. The Antared is built to live on your desk &#8212; silent, sleek, and intuitive enough that your daily session becomes as automatic as morning coffee.{% endif %}{% endif %}</p>
